{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Space Memory TDG",
    "steam_appid": 2722930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/62618f8dbcb50cc4495cf9c93c68d039.avif?t=1728322033\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Memory Meets Space Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Memory TDG takes you on an exciting journey through the universe, where you'll not only test your memory but also challenge your strategic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover and React</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover thematically designed card pairs, keep an eye on the UFOs collecting nests in the background\u2014each collection reduces your available playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is Points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is the key to success. Find all the pairs as quickly as possible and maximize your score with the remaining time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turret Mode: Action-Packed Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each successful pair, you unlock turret mode. Use this opportunity to shoot down UFOs, gain extra time, and boost your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Skill Required</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic memory gameplay with action-packed turret phases to climb to the top of the high score leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/f5fc6eb5d245eae16e2bda18571d8c8f.avif?t=1728322033\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Test: Will Humanity Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will humanity prevail in this cosmic challenge? Your memory, courage, and strategy will decide the fate of the universe\u2014step up, and make your mark among the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.poster.avif?t=1728322033\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.webm?t=1728322033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.mp4?t=1728322033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/62618f8dbcb50cc4495cf9c93c68d039.avif?t=1728322033\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Memory Meets Space Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Memory TDG takes you on an exciting journey through the universe, where you'll not only test your memory but also challenge your strategic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover and React</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you uncover thematically designed card pairs, keep an eye on the UFOs collecting nests in the background\u2014each collection reduces your available playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is Points</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed is the key to success. Find all the pairs as quickly as possible and maximize your score with the remaining time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turret Mode: Action-Packed Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each successful pair, you unlock turret mode. Use this opportunity to shoot down UFOs, gain extra time, and boost your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy and Skill Required</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic memory gameplay with action-packed turret phases to climb to the top of the high score leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/f5fc6eb5d245eae16e2bda18571d8c8f.avif?t=1728322033\" data-has-big width=800 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Test: Will Humanity Survive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will humanity prevail in this cosmic challenge? Your memory, courage, and strategy will decide the fate of the universe\u2014step up, and make your mark among the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.poster.avif?t=1728322033\" width=800 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.webm?t=1728322033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722930/extras/baa717247e98cb7cd906933f86e54c2c.mp4?t=1728322033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
